WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.680
SCP-682 VS SCP-3042.

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.560
Could the ultimate case of Puppy Love be the
force to counteract SCP-682’s reptilian

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.120
hatred?

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.640
Let’s take a look and see.

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:16.640
SCP-3042 is a small but superpowered dog that
bonds with one individual at a time, and basically

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.400
gradually loves them to death with constant
and unyielding affection.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:27.120
Its latest favorite person was eaten by SCP-682,
causing SCP-3042 to imprint on the monster

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.160
as a replacement.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.240
However, this was disastrous,&nbsp;
as SCP-682 immediately&nbsp;

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.400
attacked the tiny dog, causing it to run away

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:35.120
in fear.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.080
SCP-3042 charged through&nbsp;
a nearby wall - thankfully&nbsp;

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:41.120
making a hole too small for SCP-682 to escape

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.440
through - and imprinted on a nearby guard.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.600
Another test failed.

